        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.572,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "So that's something we'll fix later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 250.65,
          "en": "But for the moment we can see",
